<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Mr. PhotoPrint – third-party licences</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
  body { font: 15px/1.5 "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 920px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; } h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 2.2rem; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12.5px; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(127,127,127,.12); }
  ul.used { columns: 2; font-size: 13px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Mr. PhotoPrint – third-party licences</h1>
<p>Mr. PhotoPrint is licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0. It is built from the following open-source
components, each under its own licence, reproduced below.</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
{{#each licenses}}
<h2 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h2>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul class="used">
{{#each used_by}}<li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
